Hello,

Recently, I would like to use the hwlatdetect program which is
included in the rt-tests suite, but I was facing a problem : the
hwlat_detector module, provided by the hwlat-detector-1.0.0.patch, was
not compatible with my kernel version (debian kernel, 3.0.0-rt-amd64).
I did that patch, which I considered the 1.1.0, and that is just some
small modifications to be able to run it on 3.0.0 kernel without any
problem.

I also transmit the (interdiff) patch to change from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0 if need=
ed.
Both files are attached.

If you have any comments about the patchs, let me know,=A0I would be
happy to improve them in the light of your remarks.

Thanks,
Rapha=EBl

